amcli -u https://expnode.amaxscan.io push action amax.applybp addproducer '["amaxdevfunds",bp.coinq,"https://apollo.mypinata.cloud/ipfs/bafkreih72daoneipypub5zm2y45dant6ors4xpf6ie3cma33jaeoklsoxi","cn:CoinQ 交易所|en:CoinQ Exchange","web:https://www.coinq.com/|tw:https://x.com/CoinQExchange|tg: https://t.me/CoinQ_crypto|email:","","cn:节点产出80%由投票支持者划分，20%由节点维护者获得|en:80% of node output is divided by voting supporters, and 20% is obtained by node maintainers","cn:CoinQ 为致力于创建出一个可靠和创新的数字资产交易平台，帮助用户积累多元财富、拥有稳健的财务未来，并实现人生的财富追求。平台涵盖多个加密货币币种，包括比特币 (BTC)、以太币 (ETH) 、泰达币 (USDT)、Solana (SOL)、瑞波幣 (XRP)等数字资产，提供安全稳定、可持续、高度透明的加密货币交易服务。CoinQ 为客户创建一个优先考虑安全性、可靠性和创新的平台，实现在加密货币领域促进探索、机会和财富创造的愿景。通过加密货币，CoinQ致力帮助用户积累财富、拥有稳健的财务未来，并实现多元资产增值。让我们陪您一起踏上这段追求财富的征途，释放加密货币的无限潜力。|en:CoinQ is dedicated to creating a reliable and innovative digital asset trading platform that helps users accumulate a wealth of multi-assets, secure a stable financial future, and achieve their financial aspirations. The platform supports a variety of cryptocurrencies, including Bitcoin (BTC), Ethereum (ETH), Tether (USDT), Solana (SOL), Ripple (XRP), and many more, offering a safe, stable, sustainable, and highly transparent cryptocurrency trading service.CoinQ has built a platform that prioritizes security, reliability, and innovation, with a vision to foster exploration, opportunities, and wealth creation in the cryptocurrency space. We are committed to helping users accumulate wealth, secure a stable financial future, and achieve multi-asset appreciation through cryptocurrency. Let us accompany you on this journey of wealth creation, unlocking the limitless potential of cryptocurrency.","cn: |en: "]' -p amaxdevfunds
