amcli -u https://expnode.amaxscan.io push action amax.applybp addproducer '["amaxdevfunds",gsefundation,"https://apollo.mypinata.cloud/ipfs/bafkreie5udvsm6djnvzizd6egr57fl4wiq5rrbbuvkpj5ynk4otxmnq5fi","cn:美国全球稀缺能源基金会|en:Global Scarce Energy Foundation","web:|tw:|tg:|email:","","cn:节点产出80%由投票支持者划分，20%由节点维护者获得|en:80% of node output is divided by voting supporters, and 20% is obtained by node maintainers","cn:美国全球稀缺能源基金会（United States Global Scarce Energy Foundation）由李成洙博士于2015年在加拿大温哥华创立，致力于推动全球稀缺能源资源的保护、整合与创新性开发，促进传统矿业与前沿科技（如AI、区块链、智能金融）的深度融合，构建可持续发展的全球资源与智慧金融体系。现投资MES并与蒙古国算力中心、AQ索拉煤矿、希维能源等开展全球性战略合作。 支持全球矿产资源整合，包括煤矿、锂矿、金矿、稀土等关键战略资源，推动AI算力与能源开发协同发展，构建智能化绿色矿业新范式，引入区块链与RWA机制，强化矿产资产追踪与金融赋能，拥有跨国影响力，深度参与蒙古国、加拿大等资源经济体发展战略，机构合作网络 + 多边参与机制，基金会投资MES、蒙古国算力中心、AQ索拉煤矿、希维能源等开展全球性战略合作，推动“百矿计划”、智慧矿业、绿色能源与金融科技深度联动。通过举办国际峰会、政策倡导与项目投资，致力于构建“资源 × 技术 × 金融”的未来发展路径。全球稀缺能源基金会正以“资源安全 + 可持续金融”为核心驱动力，引领全球稀缺资源进入智慧化管理与生态共享的新纪元。|en:The United States Global Scarce Energy Foundation (GSEF) was founded by Dr. Lee Chengzhu in 2015 in Vancouver, Canada. The foundation is committed to the protection, integration, and innovative development of global scarce energy resources. It promotes deep integration between traditional mining and frontier technologies such as AI, blockchain, and intelligent finance, aiming to build a sustainable global resource and smart financial ecosystem. GSEF is currently an investor in MES and engages in strategic global partnerships with the Mongolia Computing Power Center, AQ Sora Coal Mine, and ShivEE Energy.Supports the integration of global mineral resources, including key strategic assets such as coal, lithium, gold, and rare earth elements.Promotes collaborative development between AI computing power and energy production, creating a new paradigm for smart and green mining.Introduces blockchain and RWA (Real World Asset) mechanisms to enhance traceability and financial empowerment of mineral assets.Possesses cross-border influence and is deeply involved in resource development strategies in countries like Mongolia and Canada.Builds institutional partnerships and multilateral participation networks.GSEF invests in MES, the Mongolia Computing Power Center, AQ Sora Coal Mine, ShivEE Energy, and others to promote the “Hundred Mines Plan,” smart mining, green energy, and the integration of financial technologies. Through hosting international summits, policy advocacy, and project investments, the foundation is driving the evolution of the “Resources × Technology × Finance” development model.GSEF is leading a new era of intelligent management and ecological sharing of global scarce resources, with resource security + sustainable finance at its core driving force.","cn: |en: "]' -p amaxdevfunds




